  "description": "When a moment of impulsive violence leaves Victor with a corpse on his hands, he expects his life to end. Instead, he meets Nathan, a man who seems to have been waiting for this exact moment. Nathan promises total immunity in exchange for one simple wish: Victor’s heart and body. Trapped in a contract with a man who is clearly not right in the head, Victor realizes that being rescued might just be the most painful thing that’s ever happened to him.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
